<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-09T17:42:57.418Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 17:42:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian-linked drones have struck the Khor Mor gas field in Iraqi Kurdistan, halting production and cutting about 2.8 GW of power, while Iraqi officials have asked Iran to close most border crossings and the foreign minister is negotiating militia weapons regulation with Tehran. Airstrikes by Iraqi forces have targeted three suspected militants and a tunnel in Kirkuk's Zghaitun Valley. The Iraqi National Alliance welcomed President Barzani's dialogue initiative and condemned the Khor Mor attack, while the US envoy condemned the attack and backed investigations by Erbil and Baghdad. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQRjlSd2FrSzRhU0tEbmROLW4tVVFKdVM2WnU5dzgwb1RJRkpTTUM4RV9ES3Q0cTZFSmFYaXZKalpUbVhZcDEyckNsWC1JV3E4QXlsVXBxSVM5RHlXZ1Z2Z21jMU1HMzg4Q1RxNm9sQ3JmWGsyUDBPQURDdVpxYzFscXJiOXNxSFl4MDZVTU0xQ3NGYTJoeUFGSWhKZTV1bjdGUWJlSTNueDRwbGdzMlZXZVpJUDA3c2Q5RVlndS1zU3JaeDJzd1BzeDNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNMmQtbTFtWktPWm1lM1EzUmRuYm1BWE9VaHdGY01YMmNHU3FURHprSHU0X1d2b2xJaXExVEQ0RFptd0ZRcDd6MzF2SGJYTlhRV2ltMnFYZG10dk9SZlJaQUxDeWNYN0lPWG1vclU2ZW1DV3VWMVZORmgzT3J0TkwwQ251d0lENHNoLWw2aEVGUXp0NnYyN09KaWI1bHlkUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;صوت الإمارات&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPMV9QeFU0NUh5RmJySXRnaHRfU2ZRZmhWZ0NzYWtleFNIWUhWOFNvVkNxRDVEOFFhX25WVTlneUFYand2Ykx1V19NVzJTZFB6aUQycVdkdGdsWjVaTGk3bHBjSHphWUQ2VGlNZUppTEZDOGVhOXl4ZWdwbjNzN0pjQjgyTjF1cVpFbUFJbW5uRm4?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/